@startuml EUDI_Module_Dependencies
!define COMPONENT #B8D4E0
!define NATIVE #A8B8C0

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #2C5F77
skinparam ArrowThickness 2

title EUDI Wallet - Module Dependency Graph

component "KeyManager" as km COMPONENT
component "OpenID4VCI\nClient" as vci COMPONENT
component "OpenID4VP\nClient" as vp COMPONENT
component "CredentialStore" as store COMPONENT
component "DnieReader" as dnie NATIVE
component "MRZScanner" as mrz NATIVE
component "MRZCalculator" as mrzCalc NATIVE

vci -down-> km : uses for proof
vp -down-> km : uses for key binding
vci -down-> store : persists credentials
vp -down-> store : retrieves credentials
dnie -down-> mrzCalc : derives BAC keys
mrz -down-> mrzCalc : validates format

note right of km
  **KeyManager**
  + generateKeyPair()
  + sign(keyId, message)
  + getDidKey(keyId)

  ES256 key generation
  Hardware-backed signing
  JWK and DID export
end note

note right of vci
  **OpenID4VCI Client**
  + parseOffer(uri)
  + authorize(issuer)
  + requestCredential()

  **Flow:**
  1. Parse offer
  2. Discover metadata
  3. Create proof JWT
  4. Request credential
  5. Validate and store
end note

note right of vp
  **OpenID4VP Client**
  + parseRequest(uri)
  + selectCredentials()
  + present(credentials)

  **Flow:**
  1. Parse request
  2. Match credentials
  3. Select disclosures
  4. Create key binding
  5. Submit presentation
end note

note left of store
  **CredentialStore**
  + store(credential)
  + getByType(type)
  + deleteExpired()

  Encrypted SQLite storage
  Hardware-backed encryption
end note

note left of dnie
  **DnieReader**
  + readDG1()
  + readDG2()
  + verifySOD()

  NFC ICAO 9303 reader
  BAC authentication
end note

note left of mrz
  **MRZScanner**
  + scanMRZ()
  + parseFields()

  Camera-based OCR
  Real-time detection
end note

note bottom of mrzCalc
  **MRZCalculator**
  + deriveBACKeys()
  + validateCheckDigits()

  Check digit validation
  BAC key derivation
end note

@enduml
